#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F/scripts.inc:36
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_ManOverThereSaysWeirdThings"
msgid ""
"That man over there, he says weird\n"
"things!\p"
"He's funny in a weird way.\n"
"I doubt I'll forget about him!$"
msgstr ""
"那边的那个大叔，\n"
"总是说些奇怪的话！\p"
"他怪得很有趣。\n"
"我想我是忘不了他了！$"

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F/scripts.inc:42
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_MyDataUpdatedFromRecordCorner"
msgid ""
"When I accessed the RECORD CORNER,\n"
"the data for what's hot in DEWFORD\l"
"got updated.\p"
"Now that bit of data is the same\n"
"as my friend's!$"
msgstr ""
"我用了记录角以后，\n"
"武斗镇的流行数据\l"
"就更新了。\p"
"现在那部分数据\n"
"和我朋友的一样了！$"

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F/scripts.inc:49
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_RecordCornerSoundsFun"
msgid ""
"A RECORD CORNER opened upstairs in\n"
"the POKéMON CENTER.\p"
"I don't know what it's about, but it\n"
"sounds fun. I'll go check it out!$"
msgstr ""
"宝可梦中心楼上\n"
"开了一个记录角。\p"
"我不知道是做什么的，\n"
"不过听起来很好玩。我去看看！$"
